        "step_number": 1,
        "text": "Step 1: Recall the formula for the magnitude of the cross product of two vectors. The magnitude of the cross product of vectors $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$ is given by $\\|\\mathbf{a} \\times \\mathbf{b}\\| = \\|\\mathbf{a}\\| \\|\\mathbf{b}\\| \\sin(\\theta)$, where $\\theta$ is the angle between $\\mathbf{a}$ and $\\mathbf{b}$."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 520,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 521,
        "char_start": 319,
